{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026x4GuI34rnk1794374642.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>亞太經合組織(APEC)領導人非正式會議下周在深圳召開，新聞中心今日起運作。</p><p></p><p>新聞中心設於福田的會展中心，已註冊傳媒要經指定出入口進出，並需通過安檢。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.SZ.APEC-1300.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026uPTOvXuSTA1794374599.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>新聞中心工作區域，約1.5萬平方米，除了有媒體工作區，還有新聞發布廳及信號傳輸室等設施。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.SZ.APEC-1300_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026A1QfIhBMGf1794374627.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>至於深圳國際交流中心預計是會議主會場，離新聞中心約十分鐘車程。花壇擺設吸引大批民眾和旅客拍照。有公安戒備，汽車出入口則設置可升降的防撞柱。亦見到央視的流動廣播車停泊在會場內。</p><p></p><p>APEC領導人非正式會議下周三及四在深圳舉行，美國、俄羅斯及日、韓等二十多個成員經濟體領導人出席。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T06:13:25.604974+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":258,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T04:46:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T08:57:13.018346+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T06:06:52.174968+00:00","content_hash":"1c17f6c62c1a9cf97f054890abf0541592836072a92c9079b86b01be8eead9c4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-11T06:13:25.604974+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}